<title>USA: Diamond Offshore sets first div, stock split.</title>
<headline>Diamond Offshore sets first div, stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Offshore Drilling Inc said on Thursday its board of directors declared the company's initial dividend and a two-for-one stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The cash dividend of $0.14 per share, on the pre-split shares, payable August 7 to stockholders of record on July 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable August 14 to stockholders of record on July 24.</p>
<p>Diamond Offshore, which went public in October 1996, provides offshore contract drilling of oil and gas wells.</p>
</text>
